{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近プリンシパルで毎日充実してて凄く忙しくて学業との両立が大変で焦ってるまあやです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休みあけにはテストがあるの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校行ってレッスン行って、家事をして......\nとりあえず授業中寝ないよう頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチで頑張りますよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会の時のです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はhappybirthdayということもあり沢山の方々と握手出来て凄く幸せですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに沢山の人達に歌ってもらえて、皆と写真とれて...\n私の大切な一生の宝物になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと準備も大変だったと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中には体調が悪い方もいて本当に\n忙しいのに、まあやの為に頑張ってくれてありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの会場にこられなかった方も気持ちは一緒にいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な15才の誕生日を迎えられて、まあやは幸せです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人にありがとうと、感謝の気持ちです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと笑顔になってもらえるように頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの方、お久し振りの方、初めましての方、沢山のオメデトウと、握手をありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの更新が遅れてごめんなさい\n最近携帯の調子が悪くて、充電できなかったり、消えたり...このブログもちゃんと更新出来るか心配です..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくもちゃんへ\n美雲ちゃん...\n何度も書いては消して...書いては消して..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番思うのは...大好き！！\nこれからもずっと、まあやのお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またいつでもお泊まりに来てよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯も食べにいこうねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/01/1454621/0007.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}